      "text": "From the search, I have gathered some background:\n*   **Ama Owusu** was born in Kumasi, Ghana in 1990.\n*   She has a BA in English and Linguistics from the University of Ghana (2012) and an MFA in Creative Writing from the University of East Anglia (2015).\n*   Her short fiction has appeared in publications like *Granta* and *Jalada Africa*.\n*   The novel in question is actually titled **Meridian Glass** (Cassava Press, 2023), which was longlisted for the Etisalat Prize for Literature, according to the first result. The second result confirms the title as *Meridian Glass*. I will proceed using the title **Meridian Glass**.\n\n### Step 2: Find the critical conversation around the book.\nI will search for critical discussion using the confirmed title.",
